{"meta":{"ui":"checkout","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Build a small checkout in three steps. Step 1, my cart: Espresso beans $24 x1, Ceramic mug $12 x2, Canvas tote $18 x1, with quantities I can change and the subtotal. Step 2, shipping: name, address, city, postcode and email, all required, with a message under a field that is empty or an email without an @. Step 3, payment summary: a choice of Standard delivery ($4, 3 to 5 working days) or Express ($12, next working day) that changes the total, subtotal plus delivery. Then a confirmation with an order number, my name, my email and the total I paid. I can go back a step without losing what I typed.","text":"state step=1\nstate items=[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Espresso beans\",\"price\":24,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"box\",\"tone\":\"sand\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Ceramic mug\",\"price\":12,\"qty\":2,\"kind\":\"mug\",\"tone\":\"rose\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Canvas tote\",\"price\":18,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"tote\",\"tone\":\"mint\"}]\nstate name=\"\"\nstate address=\"\"\nstate city=\"\"\nstate postcode=\"\"\nstate email=\"\"\nstate delivery=\"standard\"\nstate orderNo=\"ORD-48213\"\nlet subtotal = sum(items, i => i.qty * i.price)\nlet shipCost = delivery == \"express\" ? 12 : 4\nlet total = subtotal + shipCost\nlet nameErr = name == \"\" ? \"Name is required\" : \"\"\nlet addressErr = address == \"\" ? \"Address is required\" : \"\"\nlet cityErr = city == \"\" ? \"City is required\" : \"\"\nlet postcodeErr = postcode == \"\" ? \"Postcode is required\" : \"\"\nlet emailErr = email == \"\" ? \"Email is required\" : (contains(email, \"@\") ? \"\" : \"Enter a valid email\")\nlet shipValid = nameErr == \"\" and addressErr == \"\" and cityErr == \"\" and postcodeErr == \"\" and emailErr == \"\"\nChatCard \"Checkout\" \"Step {step} of 3\" icon:\"shopping_bag\" status:\"{step==1 ? \"Cart\" : (step==2 ? \"Shipping\" : (step==3 ? \"Payment\" : \"Done\"))}\"\n  if step == 1\n    SectionLabel \"Your cart\" \"{length(items)} items\"\n    each item in items\n      CartLine \"{item.name}\" \"\" {item.price} qty:{item.qty} kind:{item.kind} tone:{item.tone} -> items=updateWhere(items, x => x.id == item.id, x => with(x, \"qty\", result))\n    Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\", money(subtotal,\"$\",2)]]\n    TotalBar \"Subtotal\" \"Before delivery\" amount:{money(subtotal,\"$\",2)} cta:\"Next\" enabled:{length(items) > 0} -> step=2\n  if step == 2\n    SectionLabel \"Shipping address\" \"All fields required\"\n    InputField \"Full name\" \"Jane Smith\" =name error:{nameErr} -> name=name\n    InputField \"Address\" \"12 High Street\" =address error:{addressErr}\n    InputField \"City\" \"London\" =city error:{cityErr}\n    InputField \"Postcode\" \"SW1A 1AA\" =postcode error:{postcodeErr}\n    InputField \"Email\" \"you@example.com\" =email error:{emailErr}\n    Row gap:10\n      ActionButton \"Back\" quiet -> step=1\n      ActionButton \"Continue\" primary enabled:{shipValid} -> step=3\n  if step == 3\n    SectionLabel \"Delivery\" \"Choose one\"\n    OptionList \"Delivery method\" =delivery options:[\"standard\",\"express\"] details:[\"$4, 3 to 5 working days\",\"$12, next working day\"] -> delivery=result\n    Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\", money(subtotal,\"$\",2)],[\"Delivery\", money(shipCost,\"$\",2)]]\n    TotalBar \"Total\" \"Subtotal plus delivery\" amount:{money(total,\"$\",2)} cta:\"Pay\" -> step=4; orderNo=orderNo\n    Row gap:10\n      ActionButton \"Back\" quiet -> step=2\n  if step == 4\n    Receipt \"Order confirmed\" \"Thanks {name}, a receipt is on its way to {email}.\" code:{orderNo} codeLabel:\"Order number\" tone:good icon:\"check\"\n    Details rows:=[[\"Name\", name],[\"Email\", email],[\"Total paid\", money(total,\"$\",2)]]","usage":{"input_tokens":9484,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1281,"service_tier":"sta